1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,315
A site under construction needs a page for the visitors who arrive early.

2
00:00:05,315 --> 00:00:09,411
Let's set up a Coming Soon page, change its message, see how sign-ups

3
00:00:09,411 --> 00:00:12,470
work, and learn how to replace the page at launch.

4
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,660
A site that is not ready has an address.

5
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:23,771
A visitor who arrives early finds nothing useful, and has no way to

6
00:00:23,771 --> 00:00:26,980
leave an email address to hear when the site opens.

7
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:31,102
The Coming Soon recipe starts the site with one page:

8
00:00:31,102 --> 00:00:34,817
a title, a message with a launch date, a field for an email

9
00:00:34,817 --> 00:00:37,160
address, and links to social sites.

10
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,560
The page uses The Coming Soon Theme.

11
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:47,278
The Setup screen asks for the name of the site, and for a

12
00:00:47,278 --> 00:00:50,045
recipe, which is a ready-made starting point.

13
00:00:50,045 --> 00:00:54,060
Let's type a name, then open the Recipe list and choose Coming Soon.

14
00:00:54,537 --> 00:00:58,786
This recipe makes The Coming Soon Theme the theme of the site, and

15
00:00:58,786 --> 00:01:01,206
the Coming Soon page its home page.

16
00:01:01,206 --> 00:01:04,807
After the remaining questions, you select Finish Setup.

17
00:01:09,107 --> 00:01:12,900
After setup, the home page of the site is the Coming Soon page.

18
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:16,528
It shows a title, a message with a target launch date in the

19
00:01:16,528 --> 00:01:19,717
month after setup, and a field for an email address.

20
00:01:20,196 --> 00:01:25,600
The button carries the text Notify Me!, which the theme draws in capital letters.

21
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:29,700
On a wide screen, social icons sit at the side, and each one

22
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:31,439
links to another site.

23
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:36,346
Below the form, a notice says that ReCaptcha settings are not configured.

24
00:01:40,646 --> 00:01:44,086
To change the page, open Content, Content Items.

25
00:01:44,086 --> 00:01:48,036
The Coming Soon page is listed there, and Edit opens it.

26
00:01:48,498 --> 00:01:50,949
The editor lists the parts of the page:

27
00:01:50,949 --> 00:01:55,252
Title is the heading, and under Permalink a notice says that this content

28
00:01:55,252 --> 00:01:57,158
item is the current homepage.

29
00:01:57,158 --> 00:02:01,679
The form fields below include Action, the address that receives a sign-up, so

30
00:02:01,679 --> 00:02:03,258
leave them as they are.

31
00:02:03,721 --> 00:02:09,554
Under Flow, the Register widget holds the message, the Placeholder field and the Button field.

32
00:02:09,554 --> 00:02:14,571
Let's write our own message and button label, and leave InputFieldName as it is.

33
00:02:15,035 --> 00:02:18,235
Social Icons lists the icons shown on the page.

34
00:02:18,235 --> 00:02:21,556
Each one has an Icon Class and a Social Site Url.

35
00:02:21,556 --> 00:02:24,515
Let's point the first icon to our own page.

36
00:02:24,969 --> 00:02:26,765
Publish applies the changes.

37
00:02:26,765 --> 00:02:30,779
The home page of the site then shows our message and our button label.

38
00:02:34,979 --> 00:02:39,189
When a visitor selects the button, the form sends the email address to

39
00:02:39,189 --> 00:02:43,399
a workflow, a series of steps that Orchard Core runs for each sign-up.

40
00:02:44,149 --> 00:02:49,094
The workflow checks that an address was entered, runs the reCaptcha check, creates

41
00:02:49,094 --> 00:02:53,757
a user with that address, sends a confirmation email, and returns the visitor

42
00:02:53,757 --> 00:02:55,049
to the home page.

43
00:02:56,749 --> 00:03:03,088
Under Settings, Security, reCaptcha, enter the Site Key and the Secret Key that Google gives you.

44
00:03:03,088 --> 00:03:08,319
Once both are saved, the page shows the reCaptcha check in place of the notice.

45
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:13,467
The confirmation email needs an email provider.

46
00:03:13,467 --> 00:03:19,559
Enable one under Tools, Features, and set it up under Settings, Communication, Email.

47
00:03:19,559 --> 00:03:23,909
Each sign-up appears as a user under Access Control, Users.

48
00:03:28,109 --> 00:03:32,576
When the real site is ready, open the item that is to be your home page.

49
00:03:32,576 --> 00:03:36,355
Under its Permalink, check Set as homepage, then publish it.

50
00:03:36,355 --> 00:03:40,821
The item needs a permalink, and its content type must have Show homepage

51
00:03:40,821 --> 00:03:43,569
options checked in its Autoroute settings.

52
00:03:45,269 --> 00:03:46,982
Then open Design, Themes.

53
00:03:46,982 --> 00:03:50,519
The Coming Soon Theme is marked as the current Site theme.

54
00:03:50,519 --> 00:03:53,889
Select Make Current on the theme of your finished site.

55
00:03:55,889 --> 00:04:00,093
A Coming Soon page tells early visitors when to return and collects their

56
00:04:00,093 --> 00:04:04,296
email addresses, until a home page and a theme of your choice replace it.

57
00:04:04,296 --> 00:04:05,679
Thanks for watching.

